      "text": {
        "jp": "「装備＆アビリティ」ではパーティメンバーの装備品を\r\n確認したり付け替えたりできます。\r\n\r\n過去に見たチュートリアルは\r\n「システム」の「ヘルプ」からいつでも確認できます。",
        "official_en": "The Equipment & Abilities screen lets you view and change\r\nyour party members’ weapons and armor. To review previous\r\ntutorials at any time, select System, then Help.",
        "real_en": "Under Equipment & Abilities, you can check and change the equipment worn by your party members.\r\n\r\nYou can review tutorials you’ve already seen at any time under System → Help."
